quest "Lizard Raze" version 1
order as-written
terrain (4, 4, 5)

repeat 15 as wave:
    at 1.5s + wave * 6s:
        burst template.lizard_random_2e at edge("east") copies 6
        burst template.lizard_random_2e at edge("west") copies 6

# as-written: the dens queue behind every wave, so clearing early brings lizard waves forward first.
at 10s:
    place template.den_lizard_weak_0c on line(point(128, 256), point(0, 128), 3)
